          since `cold('---(z|)')` emits `x + x` and completes on frame 30
          but the next "expanded" return value is synchronously subscribed to in
          that same frame, it stacks like so:

          a
          ---(b|)
             ---(c|)
                ---(d|)
                   ---(e|)      (...which flattens into:)
          a--b--c--d--(e|)
